FEATURES

The AI StudyBuddy backend provides a collection of intelligent learning features through secure RESTful APIs. The system is designed to help students organize their study materials and automatically generate useful learning resources using artificial intelligence.

Secure User Authentication: The system provides secure user registration and login using JWT-based authentication. Passwords are hashed using bcrypt before being stored in the database. Protected APIs require a valid JWT token.

Study Material Management: Authenticated users can upload and manage their study materials. Each material is associated with its respective user and can be used as input for AI-powered learning features.

AI Summary Generation: The system uses the Google Gemini API to analyze uploaded study content and generate concise summaries containing the important concepts.

AI Flashcard Generation: The system automatically generates question-and-answer flashcards from study materials. These flashcards help students revise important concepts and practice active recall.

AI Quiz Generation: The quiz module generates multiple-choice questions based on the uploaded study content. It provides students with an interactive way to test their understanding.

AI Study Plan Generation: The system generates personalized study plans based on study content and examination dates. The generated plan organizes topics into manageable study sessions.

Role-Based Access Control: The application supports Student and Admin roles. JWT-based authorization ensures that users can access only the operations permitted for their respective roles.

MongoDB Data Storage: MongoDB is used to store user accounts, study materials, summaries, flashcards, quizzes, and study plans. Mongoose is used to define schemas and interact with the MongoDB database.

Overall, these features combine secure authentication, database management, REST APIs, and generative AI to provide an intelligent and personalized learning platform.
